# Default-deny build context: never send workstation secrets/data to a builder.
**
!Dockerfile
!trading_bot_v2/
!trading_bot_v2/**
!interface.html
!deploy/
!deploy/vps/
!deploy/vps/sqlite_backup.py
!deploy/vps/image_smoke.py
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.parquet
**/*.log
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.kline_cache/
trading_bot_v2/tests/
trading_bot_v2/backtesting/data/
trading_bot_v2/logs/
trading_bot_v2/backups/
